QUAE IN HOC VOLUMINE CONTINENTUR. <NOTE TYPE="Errata" ANCHORED=N BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0007"></COL> Col, 87, init.:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Theodorici;</HI>  leg.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Theodori.</HI> 
Col. 1138, lin. 12 (ascendendo):  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oijnavniwn</FOREIGN> ; lege  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oijnavnqwn</FOREIGN> 
