1Epistolhðé, ejn twðé kairwðé, ejn wßé kaiú eæpaqen, oåtan ejn toiðû desmoiðû</FOREIGN> <COL N="0618A"></COL> <HI REND=BOLD>838</HI>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>wÞn, ejpistevllei, levgwn. 1En thðé prwvthé mou
