hølqen proúû Pevtron, kaiú touúû suún aujtwðé oæntaû, eiøpen aujtoiðû×
Yhlafhvsatev me, oåti ouæk eijmi daimovnion swmatikovn. Kaiú
 <COL N="0634C"></COL> eujqevwû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="*" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0634" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0634D"></COL> Legendum ut edidimus  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aåyanteû,</FOREIGN>  quod nescio
cur in  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oæyanteû</FOREIGN>  nuperus editor, inscio lectore, mutaverit.</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aåyanteû aujtoún, ejpivsteusan. 3Axion deú faivnetai,
ejpeivper toiouvtou ajndroúû pepoihvmeqa mnhvmhn, ejk thðû
1Epistolhðû aujtouð thðû proúû 2Rwmaivouû grafeivshû ojlivga
ejkqevsqai. «1Apoú Surivaû aæcri 2Rwvmhû, qhriomacwð ejn qalavsshé
kaiú ejn ghðé, nuktoúû kaiú hJmevraû, devka sundemevnoû
leopavrdoiû, toutevsti stratiwvtaiû toiðû fulavssousiv me,
 <COL N="0636A"></COL> oiåtineû kaiú metaú eujergesivan ceivroneû givnontai. AiJ gaúr
