ajf1 wßn eægrayaû,</FOREIGN>   <HI REND=BOLD>876</HI>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejpimelwðû, kaiú tauvthn
thún katavkrisin oJmoivwû metagravyhéû, kaqwúû eußreû ejn toiðû
