c. 1,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Aijqivopeû oiJ ejswvteroi</FOREIGN>  appellentur.</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejswvteroi. Qavptetai deú ejn Pavtraiû thðû 1Acaièaû,
