 <COL N="0722B"></COL> toú kataú Matqaiðon aujtoiðû eujaggevlion eædwken. 1Ekoimhvqh dev
ejn 1Albanopovlei thðû megavlhû 1Armenivaû.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0722"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>E. Qwmaðû oJ ajpovstoloû, kaqwúû hJ paravdosiû perievcei,
