quod utcumque verum est radice  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230777I" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">motus,
sive agitatus fuit,</HI>  vel  <HI REND="ITALIC">movit sese.</HI>  Verissime autem
Hieron.  <HI REND="ITALIC">negotiator</HI>  exponit, quippe  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230777I" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">mercator,</HI> 
