etymologia, quae ex Hebraea radice,  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230777J" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT>   <HI REND="ITALIC">depressit,</HI> 
sive  <HI REND="ITALIC">prostravit,</HI>  exprimitur.</NOTE> ,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>savloû,</FOREIGN>  hoc est motus
