Cappadoces.</ITEM> <ITEM>Chethaeus ( <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230777D" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> ), mentis excessus,
sive fixus, vel abscisus. Sed
hoc nomen in Hebraico non incipit
a consonanti littera, verum ab
 <HI REND="ITALIC">heth,</HI>  de qua jam supra diximus.</ITEM> <ITEM>Chaldaei <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0777" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0777A"></COL> Hebraice  <HI REND="ITALIC">Chasdim,</HI>  id est  <HI REND="ITALIC">quasi daemones,</HI>  aut
