et  <HI REND="ITALIC">Scheddin,</HI>  id est  <HI REND="ITALIC">daemones,</HI>  a  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230777K" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Schedad,
