vel ornatus.</ITEM> <ITEM>Evila, dolens, sive parturiens.</ITEM> <ITEM>Euphrates, frugifer, sive crescens.</ITEM> <ITEM>Eva, calamitas, aut vae, vel vita.</ITEM> <ITEM>Enoch, dedicatio.</ITEM> <ITEM>Enos, homo, sive desperatus,
vel violentus.</ITEM> <ITEM>Evaeum, ferum, sive pessimum.</ITEM> <ITEM>Eber, transitorem.</ITEM> <ITEM>Elmodad, ad matrem ejus praecipuam,
