Pseudo-Hieronymus in eumdem psalm.:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Edom,</HI>  inquit,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">interpretatur terrena et sanguinem.</HI></NOTE> , rufus, sive terrenus.</ITEM> <ITEM>Emor, asinus.</ITEM> <ITEM>Ephrata, ubertas, sive pulverulenta.</ITEM> <ITEM>Eser <NOTE N="i" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0778" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0778B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Eser.</HI>  In editis et nonnullis mss. codicibus:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Eser,
fictus,</HI>  id est,  <HI REND="ITALIC">plasmatus.</HI>   <ED>MARTIAN.</ED> —Noster ms.
cum vulgo editis libris,  <HI REND="ITALIC">fictus, sive plasmatus.</HI></NOTE> , fictio, sive plasma.</ITEM> <ITEM>Esban, ignis in eis.</ITEM> <ITEM>Efraim, frugiferum, sive crescentem.</ITEM> <ITEM>Esrom ( <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230778C" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> ), sagittam videns.</ITEM> <ITEM>Esbel ( <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230778C" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> ), ignis vanus, sive
