 <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>diaú thún paroikivan</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">interpretatur.</HI>  A  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230780I" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT>  et  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230780I" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> , ut nemo
