sive percussum.</ITEM> <ITEM>Ludiim, nati, sive prosunt fortiter.</ITEM> <ITEM>Laabim, deusti sive flammantes.</ITEM> <ITEM>Lasa, in salutem.</ITEM> <ITEM>Lud, utilis.</ITEM> <ITEM><HI REND=BOLD>13</HI>  Lot, vinctus, sive declinatio.</ITEM> <ITEM>Laban, candidus.</ITEM> <ITEM>Latusim, malleatores.</ITEM> <ITEM>Loommin, tribus, sive matres.</ITEM> <ITEM>Lia, laboriosa.</ITEM> <ITEM>Levi, additus, sive assumptus.</ITEM> <ITEM><COL N="0781"></COL> Lotan, vinculum eorum, sive
ipse conclusus.</ITEM> <CAPTION COM="0781">M.</CAPTION> <ITEM>Mahuiael, quis est Dominus
Deus? vel ex vita Deus.</ITEM> <ITEM>Mathusale, mortis emissio, vel
