defectio, aut certe compressus.</ITEM> <ITEM>Mesraim, hostes eorum, sive
mensura. Sed sciendum quod Mesraim,
Aegyptus appellatur.</ITEM> <ITEM>Mesa ( <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230781I" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> ), aqua rara, <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0781" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0781A"></COL> In ms. nostro  <HI REND="ITALIC">vel evado:</HI>  vitiose, ut non
dubito.</NOTE>  vel
elatio.</ITEM> <ITEM>Melcha, regina ejus.</ITEM> <ITEM>Mamre, de visione, sive perspicuam.</ITEM> <ITEM>Masec ( <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230781J" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> ), potum dans, sive
