non enim  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230784I" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT>   <HI REND="ITALIC">corrigiam</HI>  sonat, sed  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230784I" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> . Graece
etiam est penes LXX  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Serouúc.</FOREIGN>  Alterum glossema,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">sive perfectus;</HI>  in mendo cubare existimo ex compendio
litterarum in antiquis libris nato. Et vero
legi malim  <HI REND="ITALIC">profectus,</HI>  in Graeco enim Origenis Lexico
 <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Serouúg ajpavrthma</FOREIGN>  vertitur;  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajpavrthma</FOREIGN>  vero interpretamur
