interpretatur.</HI>  Nuperus Origenis Editor suspicatur
deduci ex  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230790C" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> , quod in  <HI REND="ITALIC">Pibel</HI>  sonat  <HI REND="ITALIC">tentavit,
probavit. Rubus</HI>  a  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230790C" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT>  interpretatur.</NOTE>  tentatio, sive
