in Numer:  <HI REND="ITALIC">In interpretatione,</HI>  inquit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Hebraicorum
nominum Sattin invenimus in lingua nostra responsionem,
vel refutationem dici.</HI>  Vid. Num. 25, 1.
 <COL N="0790B"></COL> In ms. nostro aspiratur  <HI REND="ITALIC">Sethim:</HI>  in uno Colbertino,
