qui exclusio, vel devoratio interpretatur.</HI>  Forte ex
 <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230792F" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">exinanivit, exclusit,</HI>  vel a  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230792F" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">absorpsit, devoravit.</HI></NOTE>  solet
