e diversis Scripturae libris interdum contulissent.
 <ED>MARTIAN.</ED> —Noster ms.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Bechor in sagmate,
vel ingressus,</HI>  absque  <HI REND="ITALIC">agnus</HI>  voce: olim editi  <HI REND="ITALIC">vel ingressus
