 <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230794D" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT>   <HI REND="ITALIC">os</HI>  deducta expositio. Origeni dicitur,  <HI REND="ITALIC">suavitas,
vel oris pellis.</HI></NOTE> , oris pellis, vel
hiavit.</ITEM> <ITEM>Finees, os requievit, sile <NOTE N="i" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0794" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0794B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Finees, os requievit, sile,</HI>  etc. Ms. Colbertin. 4951
non legit hanc vocem  <HI REND="ITALIC">sile;</HI>  sed tantum,  <HI REND="ITALIC">os requievit,</HI> 
