qui et Taurus. Inde Amana, inquietus, turbulentus,
vel dens vigiliarum.</HI>  Consule Martianaeum.</NOTE> , congregatio eorum.</ITEM> <ITEM>Apheo, continuit, sive continentia.</ITEM> <ITEM>Adraim, inundatio pessimorum.</ITEM> <ITEM>Accaron, <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0801" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0801A"></COL> Equidem malim pro  <HI REND="ITALIC">eruditio</HI>  rescribi  <HI REND="ITALIC">eradicatio:</HI> 
