Eliam,</HI>  etc. Denique cum  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230802F" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT>   <HI REND="ITALIC">elil</HI>  significet  <HI REND="ITALIC">nihilum</HI> 
et  <HI REND="ITALIC">inutile,</HI>  nomen  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230802F" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Alal, levitatem</HI>  sonare aptum
