et  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230809F" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT>   <HI REND="ITALIC">pater.</HI></NOTE>  patris mei decor.</ITEM> <ITEM>Abel, luctus, vel committens.</ITEM> <ITEM>Abelmeola, luctus parturientis.</ITEM> <ITEM>Ares ( <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230809D" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> ), sol.</ITEM> <ITEM>Abed, servus.</ITEM> <ITEM>Armon, anathema moeroris, vel
