—Aliquot mss. penes Martian.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">electio optima.</HI></NOTE>  electa, optima.</ITEM> <ITEM>Salma ( <HI REND="ITALIC">Salmana</HI> ), sentiens, vel
 <COL N="0811"></COL> perfecta, sive pacifica.</ITEM> <CAPTION COM="0811">T.</CAPTION> <ITEM>Tabath ( <HI REND="ITALIC">Tebbath</HI> ), bona.</ITEM> <ITEM><HI REND="ITALIC">Excepto hoc nomine, caetera, quae
