eorum.</ITEM> <ITEM>Azeca, fortitudo, sive decipula.</ITEM> <ITEM>Adreel ( <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230812A" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> ) greges Dei.</ITEM> <ITEM>Azel, abiens, pergens.</ITEM> <ITEM>Achis, verumtamen vir, sive frater
