quibus falso asserit Martianaeus, non sine soloecismo
esse in  <HI REND="ITALIC">ea</HI>  pro  <HI REND="ITALIC">eo.</HI>  Verum pro  <HI REND="ITALIC">Abisa</HI>  legendum
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Aphsiba,</HI>  ipsum Hebraicum etymon  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230824E" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> , Graecaque
