 <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0828" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0828A"></COL> Veteres Proculum vocabant eum, qui, patre
longius peregrinante, esset natus.</NOTE>  Proculus.</ITEM> <ITEM>Thoph ( <HI REND="ITALIC">Topheth</HI> ), protectio oris,
