ab Apostolis, cognomen tulisse Barnabae, quo significaretur
 <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>uiJoúû paraklhvsewû,</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Filius consolationis.</HI>  Oecumenius,
ad Actor. IV, 36, denotare ait hoc nomen
 <COL N="0847A"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>paramuqivan, kaiú oijktirmoún,</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">consolationem, miserationemque.</HI> 
