—Veteres editi,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Sinai, sentis, aut secundus,</HI>  etc. Et
 <HI REND="ITALIC">senticetum</HI>  quidem, sive  <HI REND="ITALIC">rubetum,</HI>  a rubis, in quorum
uno Moses Deum vidit, ex  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0230849B" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT>  radice,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Sinai</HI>  optime
