 <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejpwmivû.</FOREIGN></ITEM> <ITEM>Jesus salvator, vel salvans.</ITEM> <ITEM>Eliu, Deus meus iste.</ITEM> <ITEM>Elisaeus, Dei mei salus.</ITEM> <ITEM>Zachaeus, justificatus, aut justus,
