 <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0231158C" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Cadar</HI>  Hebraice idem est quod  <HI REND="ITALIC">obtenebratus,</HI>  vel
