Dei est gratia.</HI></NOTE> ,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejn wßé eæstin cavriû.</FOREIGN></ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Iaveiroû,</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1162" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1162B"></COL> Reposuimus ex Vatican. et Colbertin.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>fwtisqeiúû,</FOREIGN> 
