hæ oiøkoû paraklhvsewû.</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Capernaum, villa vel domus consolationis.</HI></NOTE> ,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kwvmhû paravklhsiû.</FOREIGN></ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Leueiú, proskeivmenoû.</FOREIGN></ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Lavmec, plhvxantoû, hÞ tapeivnwsiû.</FOREIGN></ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Lavzaroû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="5" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1162" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1162A"></COL> Ut  <HI REND="ITALIC">Lazarus</HI>  possit non absurde  <HI REND="ITALIC">a patre adjutus</HI> 
