Graeci legerint  <HI REND="ITALIC">Labsaros:</HI>  alioqui nomen illud nuda
ratione poterit verti,  <HI REND="ITALIC">a patre adjutus.</HI></NOTE> ,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>patroúû bohqouvmenoû.</FOREIGN></ITEM> <ITEM><NOTE N="6" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1162" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1162A"></COL> Corrupte scribunt Graeci  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Lwúl</FOREIGN>  pro  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Lwvt,</FOREIGN>  nec  <HI REND="ITALIC">redempti</HI> 
