me.</ITEM> <ITEM>Pontius, declinans consilium.</ITEM> <ITEM>Pilatus, os malleatoris.</ITEM> <ITEM>Petrus, agnoscens, vel dissolvens.</ITEM> <ITEM>Rama, excelsa, sive exaltata.</ITEM> <ITEM>Rachel, ovis, vel videns Deum.</ITEM> <ITEM>Raab, lata, sive dilatata.</ITEM> <ITEM>Ruth, festinans.</ITEM> <ITEM>Racha, vanus.</ITEM> <ITEM>Rabbi, magister meus. Syrum est.</ITEM> <ITEM>Sidon, venatio.</ITEM> <ITEM>Talitha cumi, puella surge. Syrum
