fortuna.</ITEM> <ITEM>Aser, beatitudo, sive beatus.</ITEM> <ITEM>Joseph, augmentum.</ITEM> <ITEM>Benjamin, filius dextrae.</ITEM> <ITEM>Melchisedec, rex justus.</ITEM> <CAPTION COM="1168"><COL N="1170"></COL> FILII RUBEN.</CAPTION> <ITEM>Ruben, videns filius, vel videns in
