NOMINUM HEBRAICORUM.</CAPTION> <ITEM>Eva, vita.</ITEM> <ITEM>Sara, fasciculus visus, vel sterilis,
aut princeps.</ITEM> <ITEM><COL N="1175"></COL> Agar, ipsa proselyta, vel simul nutrix,
aut advena est.</ITEM> <ITEM>Rebecca, multa patientia, vel varia,
