obiter dixi.</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>bohqeiva</FOREIGN> .</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Acimaúû, ajdelfovû mou boulhv</FOREIGN> .</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Acitwúb, ajdelfovû mou ajgaqovû</FOREIGN> .</ITEM> <ITEM><NOTE N="5" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1212" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1212A"></COL> Lepida interpretatio nominis  <HI REND="ITALIC">Achitopel,</HI>  quam
