abjicienda, eamque in Graeciam amandare debemus.</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Acitwvfel, ajdelfovû mou</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1212" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1212B"></COL> Ita quidem praefert et Vatic.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>trwðsiû</FOREIGN> ; sed quantum
