Latino.</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>skotighð, diwvktria.</FOREIGN></ITEM> <ITEM><NOTE N="2" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1255" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1255A"></COL> Nullum est nomen Hebraeum  <HI REND="ITALIC">Aitas</HI>  in Scriptura
