Graecae peritiores. Nescio an  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajnasthúû</FOREIGN>  vel potius
 <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajnaseisthúû</FOREIGN>  legendum.</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>3Annaû, ajnasusthvû.</FOREIGN></ITEM> <CAPTION COM="1257"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>B</FOREIGN></CAPTION> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Barnhú,</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="8" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1258" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1258A"></COL> Soloecizant Graeci in nominibus  <HI REND="ITALIC">Barne</HI>  et  <HI REND="ITALIC">Bersabee:</HI> 
