repraesentat.</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>2Oovliba, moicalivû.</FOREIGN></ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>4Odolla, povrnh.</FOREIGN></ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>2Ozivaû, ijscuúû qeouð.</FOREIGN></ITEM> <CAPTION COM="1267"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>P</FOREIGN></CAPTION> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Pavsca</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="3" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1267" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1267A"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Pascha,</HI>  sive  <HI REND="ITALIC">Phasee</HI>  dicitur  <HI REND="ITALIC">redemptio</HI>  et  <HI REND="ITALIC">libertas,</HI> 
