Paschae seu immolationis  <HI REND="ITALIC">Phasee,</HI>  liberi exierint de
Aegypto, ac redempti e durissima captivitate, qua
 <COL N="1268A"></COL> opprimebantur.</NOTE> ,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>diabathvrion, luvtrwsiû.</FOREIGN></ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Pesseúc, ejleuqeriva.</FOREIGN></ITEM> <ITEM><NOTE N="4" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1268" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1268A"></COL> Hoc nomen scriptum est  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0231268A" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT>  in Hebraeo cum
