COLLECTA. <NOTE TYPE=chad ANCHORED=N COM="1281" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1281"></COL> In Migne, the sections of text headed  <HI REND="ITALIC">Interpres Latin., Philo.,</HI>  and  <HI REND="ITALIC">Hieronymus</HI>  are printed in parallel.</NOTE></HEAD> <COL N="1281"></COL> <DIV1 SECOND=YES COM="1281"><HEAD COM="1281"><HI REND="ITALIC">Interpres Latin.</HI></HEAD> <COL N="1281"></COL> <LIST COM="1281"><CAPTION COM="1281">A</CAPTION> <ITEM>Adam, terra.</ITEM> <ITEM>Abel, nomen est lugentis.</ITEM> <ITEM>Abraham, pater sublimis.</ITEM> <ITEM>Abram, pater electus soni.</ITEM> <ITEM>Abiud, pater meus.</ITEM> <ITEM>Aelim, portae interpretantur.</ITEM> <ITEM>Aethiopia, humilitas.</ITEM> <ITEM>Agar, inquilinus.</ITEM> <ITEM>Amalec, populus elingens.</ITEM> <ITEM>Anna, gratia.</ITEM> <ITEM>Aaron, montanus.</ITEM> <ITEM>Arphaxat, qui exponitur,  <HI REND="ITALIC">conturbavit
