 <HI REND="ITALIC">patha,</HI>  idem est quod  <HI REND="ITALIC">persuadeo,</HI>  aut  <HI REND="ITALIC">persuasus fuit.</HI> 
Hieronymus compositum voluit ex  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0231288B" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT>   <HI REND="ITALIC">phe,</HI>  et  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0231288B" TEXT="[Hebrew Text]"></ORNAMENT> 
